{"asset_key":"ep1/herohub_story_11411010","episode":"ep1","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"11411010","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:3:1141101001:1":{"text":"Honestly, when I first laid eyes on Alsa rolling towards us from a distance, I was scared...","source_cn":"说起来，最开始见到阿尔萨时，我吓了一跳呢！就看到一个球...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6945857B467A9FA4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1141101002:1":{"text":"Yes! Alsa might just be the only Mauler in the world who can curl up into a ball.","source_cn":"唔……是呢，这么多蛮血，好像也只见过阿尔萨可以缩成球形。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5C90E968CC5D3453","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1141101003:1":{"text":"Err... I...","source_cn":"啊……这个……这个嘛……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBC371A13E917DAA1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:6:1141101003":{"text":"Err... I...","source_cn":"啊……这个……这个嘛……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBC371A13E917DAA1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1141101004:1":{"text":"You're not far off.","source_cn":"这样说倒是也没错。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAF585BDD5B9B2D9E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1141101006:1":{"text":"The people at the Uru Settlement used to think she was a ball. Actually, the little Alsa would have curled up by now.","source_cn":"乌尔聚落的大家甚至最早以为她就是一个球。如果是小时候的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDB703CAAE92955D3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1141101007:1":{"text":"You know why, <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>?","source_cn":"<style=stress><player_name>...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xFC7D38AC60FC79FA","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"You know why, <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>?","female":"You know why, <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>?","variant_male_record_index":"125163","variant_female_record_index":"125164","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:12:1141101007":{"text":"You know why, <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>?","source_cn":"<style=stress><player_name></style>，你能猜到是为什么吗？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xFC7D38AC60FC79FA","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"You know why, <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>?","female":"You know why, <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>?","variant_male_record_index":"125163","variant_female_record_index":"125164","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1141101008:1":{"text":"Whenever Alsa felt shy, scared, or wanted to hide, she'd curl up into a ball. She's changed a lot since then.","source_cn":"无论是害羞、害怕，或者想逃避的时候，阿尔萨都会缩成球。...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFA925488C02B5F3D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1141101009:1":{"text":"Yeah... Pops put a lot of effort into getting rid of that bad habit of mine.","source_cn":"是啊……老爹为了改掉我这个坏习惯，真是花了很多心思呢。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3ED70FB7936253EB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1141101010:1":{"text":"I used to curl up without even realizing it whenever I felt uneasy or insecure. It was my way of feeling safe.","source_cn":"我感到不安的时候总是会下意识把自己包起来，也只有那样才...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x53DE73F8B751FDAB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1141101011:1":{"text":"But you know what really makes me feel safe now? The attention and trust from people like you guys...","source_cn":"但真正让我感到安心的，是大家对我的关注与信赖……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x67D8F20EA5D64A2E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1141101012:1":{"text":"These days, I save that defensive side for my enemies, not my friends!","source_cn":"现在坚实防御的一面，我会留给敌人，而不是留给我的朋友！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6D0F42B2C922A6A4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:12:0:1":{"text":"Because you were shy?","source_cn":"是因为害羞？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x0C7AAF678C94A174","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Because you were shy?","female":"Because you were shy?","variant_male_record_index":"64208","variant_female_record_index":"64209","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:12:1:2":{"text":"Because you were scared?","source_cn":"是因为害怕？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xCAD2A0E547F79138","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Because you were scared?","female":"Because you were scared?","variant_male_record_index":"64210","variant_female_record_index":"64211","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:6:0:1":{"text":"You felt safer like that?","source_cn":"用来保护自己？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x517E90A536BAAAFB","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"You felt safer like that?","female":"You felt safer like that?","variant_male_record_index":"64204","variant_female_record_index":"64205","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1141101005:0":{"text":"To be more precise...","source_cn":"这样说更确切些。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x24D586CA573B9D2B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:6:1:2":{"text":"You liked the speed it gave you?","source_cn":"不想面对别人？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x5555919E8BB5400A","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"You liked the speed it gave you?","female":"Yo